  "item_short_desc": "<p>Inspired from the functionality and practicality of American military attire, our Twill BDU Shirts are designed to tackle the roughest outdoor elements while providing comfortable all-day wear and adaptability. These button-down shirts are the real deal and can handle whatever you throw at them.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "11364",
  "description": "<p>Inspired from the functionality and practicality of American military attire, our Twill BDU Shirts are designed to tackle the roughest outdoor elements while providing comfortable all-day wear and adaptability. These button-down shirts are the real deal and can handle whatever you throw at them. Tried-and-True Reliability: These tactical shirts feature reinforced elbow patches for maximum durability that endures wear and tear while protecting your arms. The double-stitched seams provide extra strength and years of reliable use, while the front button-flap closure shields you from outdoor debris. High-Capacity Utility Pockets: The long sleeve shirt comes equipped with four large button-down bellow pockets that expand when being used and stay flat when not. These front utility pockets are perfect for holding everyday essentials like your phone, wallet, keys, or multi-tool. Unparalleled Durability: Each military shirt is crafted with a long-lasting 55% cotton / 45% polyester twill fabric. This blend provides unmatched resiliency and easy-to-care-for maintenance (machine washable). These shirt jackets aren&rsquo;t afraid to get down and dirty out in the wilderness. Supreme Comfort &amp; Fit: The adjustable button-tab wrist cuffs allow you to adjust your sleeves as needed. These combat uniform shirts also incorporate button-tabs on the waist for a perfect fit. They can be worn as a shirt or jacket, making for a great shacket. A Full Set: Complete your uniform with a matching pair of our Tactical BDU Cargo Pants or Relaxed Fit Zipper Fly BDU Pants.</p>",
